---
/**
 * The privacy policy (synced from the app repo) plus the website's own
 * addendum for the beta list, which the app's policy does not cover yet.
 * Keep the addendum in step with functions/api/beta.ts and
 * migrations/0001_beta_list.sql. TODO(legal): fold it into the policy in the
 * app repo (docs/TASKS.md), then remove it here.
 */
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { mailto, site } from '../config/site';
---

<LegalPage
  id="privacy"
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="What the Aftertaste app collects, why, who else handles it, and how to export or delete your data. Short and plain."
  addendumToc={[{ slug: 'beta-list', text: 'Website: the beta list' }]}
>
  <section slot="addendum" class="addendum" aria-labelledby="beta-list">
    <p class="t-label addendum-kicker">Website addendum</p>
    <h2 id="beta-list">Website: the beta list</h2>
    <p>
      This part covers the “Save your seat” form on {site.url.replace('https://', '')}, not the app. The same person is
      responsible for it as for the app (see the top of this policy).
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>What we collect.</strong> Your email address and, if you add them, your city and how you heard about us.
        We also record the time you signed up. That is all: we do not store your IP address or browser details, and the
        form sets no cookies.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Why.</strong> To invite you to the private beta and to tell you when Aftertaste launches. Your city and
        how you heard about us help us decide where to open next. We send nothing else, and we never sell or share the
        list. We rely on your consent, which you give by joining and can withdraw at any time.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Stopping abuse.</strong> To slow down automated sign-ups, the form counts attempts from each network.
        For that it keeps a one-way, keyed hash of your network address that changes every hour; the address itself is
        never stored, and the hash is deleted once its hour is over (with the next sign-up after that).
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Who handles it.</strong> Cloudflare hosts this website and the database that holds the list, and
        processes it for us.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>How long we keep it.</strong> Until six months after Aftertaste launches, or until you ask us to remove
        you, whichever comes first.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Leaving the list.</strong> Email{' '}
        <a href={mailto('Remove me from the beta list')}>{site.contactEmail}</a> from the address you signed up with,
        and we will delete your entry.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</LegalPage>
